Subject: [PATCH 1/3] =?UTF-8?q?ramips/mt7621:=20=D0=BF=D1=80=D0=B8=D0=B2?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=B5=D1=81=D1=82=D0=B8=20DTB=20PEJIR01=20=D0=BA=20=D1=80?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=B5=D0=B0=D0=BB=D1=8C=D0=BD=D0=BE=D0=BC=D1=83=20=D0=B6=D0=B5?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=BB=D0=B5=D0=B7=D1=83?=
